# Added by ios-android-builder setup-credentials.sh — never commit credentials
*.p8
*.jks
*.keystore
**/key.properties

# Built .gvoice packs — NEVER committed. This repo is PUBLIC (MIT); packs embed
# `source/ref.wav`, which for our two hosts is a recording of a real person
# (see supertonic-mlx-spike/refs/README.md: "These are recordings of real
# people"). Publishing them would be irreversible. Build them locally with
# `spike gvoice-build` and keep them in a private location.
packs/
